  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v10.0.2-alpha1 - RTSW Magnetic Data + Robustness Improvements\n\nNew Features\n- RTSW Magnetometer Support: Added `GetRtswMag1MinDataAsync()` for real-time solar wind magnetic field data\n- Endpoint: `/json/rtsw/rtsw_mag_1m.json`\n\nCritical Fixes\n- Exception Handling: Added robust error handling to all HTTP clients\n- JSON empty/null validation before deserialization\n- Try-catch with `JsonException` wrapping\n- Null-check after deserialization with descriptive messages\n- Affected: `KpIndex1MinClient`, `KpIndexForecastClient`, `OvationAuroraLatestClient`\n\n Code Quality\n- Removed redundant null-forgiving operators (`!`) in `GetAsync()` methods\n- Removed all commented-out code blocks\n- Standardized `KpIndex1MRawItem` properties to PascalCase (`timeTag` → `TimeTag`, etc.)",
